{"version":1,"content":"<p>「樂壇小天后」炎明熹成為首奪「叱咤」女歌手金獎的頂頭大熱，不過尚有「臣之女」陳康堤及備受看好的黃淑蔓跟她爭獎；</p><p>至於同樣出道5年的張天賦（MC）已視男歌手金獎為囊中物，豪言信心達120%，難怪上年度奪金的馮允謙都打定輸數。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T19:25:25.364432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T19:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:20.466663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:20.466663+00:00","content_hash":"482d9147cb483635544085bb62e9e3ae98200f86a4be29ff96bcde67b613ea38","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}